null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":7,"created_at":"2025-11-05T10:42:35Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T08:52:23Z","closed_at":"2025-12-02T08:19:11Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.6.dev3.official [9d84f3d13]\n\n### System information\n\nlinux\n\n### Issue description\n\nOverall, I’m glad to see the new version released as always, but after switching to it, I noticed something wrong with my model’s Armature. Parts of the body that were bound to bones are now positioned incorrectly. In dev2 everything still works fine — this issue appears only in dev3.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThere are a few possible explanations:\n\n1. In version 4.6.dev2, the Armature positions were slightly off (a bit lower). (In Godot you can see the bounding box sits higher than the legs but still contains them, though animations and everything else worked correctly.) So maybe dev3 fixed the Armature animation system.\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1054\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3422f16f-eec6-4a66-baa0-6090e74a59fe\" />\n\n2. In version 4.6.dev3, the positions are actually wrong — they appear shifted. (Now they fit correctly inside the bounding box, but their spatial placement is broken.) This only affects existing scenes; for example, a freshly imported .glb file works fine because it’s reloaded under the new system. But I’m concerned this might be a widespread issue that could break dozens of models.\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1054\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57be56ab-2ee0-4335-b279-651f2ee459bb\" />\n\n3. The model was originally made incorrectly (which is unlikely).\n\n<img width=\"1446\" height=\"743\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3107b990-e26e-499a-9605-77e64c8838d2\" />\n\nThis also confirms that in dev3 the object’s origin point matches correctly:\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1054\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd01dbfd-5e0e-4d2f-a61f-e4f614896e52\" />\n\n---\n\nSo my conclusion is simple: It’s possible that animations were fixed in this version — which is great — but the migration process might break dozens of existing models.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n--","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112427/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112427/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}